    icon: '🃏',
  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. Players take turns flipping one card face-up onto a central pile in a rhythmic fashion.\n2. **The Chant**: As each card is played, the current player says a rank in ascending order: 'Seven', 'Eight', 'Nine', 'Ten', 'Jack', 'Queen', 'King', 'Ace', then repeats.\n3. **The Kloepper (Knock)**: If the card revealed matches the rank being spoken, all players must immediately slap their hand onto the central pile.\n4. **Penalty**: The last player to slap takes the entire pile of cards and adds it to their personal stack.\n5. **Fake-Outs**: If a player slaps the pile when no match has occurred, they take the pile as a penalty.",
    Player: "1. Players take turns flipping one card face-up onto a central pile in a rhythmic fashion.\n2. **The Chant**: As each card is played, the current player says a rank in ascending order: 'Seven', 'Eight', 'Nine', 'Ten', 'Jack', 'Queen', 'King', 'Ace', then repeats.\n3. **The Kloepper (Knock)**: If the card revealed matches the rank being spoken, all players must immediately slap their hand onto the central pile.\n4. **Penalty**: The last player to slap takes the entire pile of cards and adds it to their personal stack.\n5. **Fake-Outs**: If a player slaps the pile when no match has occurred, they take the pile as a penalty.",
    objective: 'Avoid being the last player to slap the pile (or be the first, depending on variant) and capture all cards to win.',
    gameplay: "1. Players take turns flipping one card face-up onto a central pile in a rhythmic fashion.\n2. **The Chant**: As each card is played, the current player says a rank in ascending order: 'Seven', 'Eight', 'Nine', 'Ten', 'Jack', 'Queen', 'King', 'Ace', then repeats.\n3. **The Kloepper (Knock)**: If the card revealed matches the rank being spoken, all players must immediately slap their hand onto the central pile.\n4. **Penalty**: The last player to slap takes the entire pile of cards and adds it to their personal stack.\n5. **Fake-Outs**: If a player slaps the pile when no match has occurred, they take the pile as a penalty.",
    keyRules: [
      'Players chant ranks in ascending order',
      'Slap when card matches the spoken rank',
      'Last to slap takes the pile',
      'False slaps result in penalty',
